WEBVTT

00:00:01.077 --> 00:00:06.268
1. Drag the button to your bookmarks bar

00:00:06.268 --> 00:00:08.473
No bookmarks bar? Press Shift Command B

00:00:08.473 --> 00:00:12.334
2. Open Nova's bidding platform

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:14.339
Sign in with your Nova account

00:00:14.339 --> 00:00:18.196
3. Go to the tab Rank

00:00:18.196 --> 00:00:23.376
4. Click the button in your bookmarks bar

00:00:23.376 --> 00:00:27.337
It reads bids and seats only, never names or student numbers

00:00:27.337 --> 00:00:35.875
5. Paste it into Lance and press Share

00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:38.483
Done. The next students see what a seat cost.
